# Libraries permitted in tooling/**/dune (libraries ...) stanzas.
#
# Discipline: the daemon (and sibling tooling components) must talk to
# EasyCrypt only through the `ec llm` subprocess protocol — never by
# linking EC internals. Anything in a tooling dune file's (libraries ...)
# stanza must appear here, or the boundary lint fails.
#
# When you legitimately need a new dep, add it here in the same commit
# that introduces the dune change.

# In-repo libraries
ecd_core

# Stdlib-adjacent (always fine)
str
unix
threads
bytes

# Core daemon deps (Phase 0a)
cmdliner
logs
logs.fmt
yojson

# Concurrency (Phase 1)
eio
eio_main
eio.core
eio.runtime
eio.unix

# TUI (ecd tui — Phase 2+)
notty
notty.unix

# LSP framing — JSON-RPC primitives shared by the daemon library and
# scripted clients in the conformance smokes (Phase 5-core / Stage 3+).
# The lsp_io framing layer is implemented natively in Eio without
# Lsp.Io.Make. The daemon library currently hand-encodes LSP method
# payloads (Diagnostic, Position, etc.) as Yojson; the `lsp` package
# is reserved for conformance smokes that want typed Lsp.Types.*
# constructors when asserting wire shapes.
jsonrpc
lsp
